<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading"><SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title=""/><Text>INT. COURTROOM - DAY</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>INSPECTOR DAS rises.</Text></Paragraph>
