 20th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 21th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 22th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 23th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 24th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 25th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 26th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 27th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 28th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 29th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen. On the night of the 30th the signal was green, the platform was empty and the clock read two fourteen.</Text></Paragraph>
